   "img": "systems/10kswordsfoundry/assets/icons/accessory.svg",
   "system": {
    "description": "<p>There are 108,000,000 Angels and there are 666,666,666 Demons. Angels are servants of the Gods and are powered by Magicite and Sidhi. The most powerful angels are powered by exploding stars. TECHNICALLY A HALF TRUTH // ANGELS ARE UNKNOWABLE ARTIFICIAL CONSCIOUSNESSES. AUTOMATA MADE WITH NEUTRON STAR CARAPACES AND SUPERNOVA HEARTS. THEY SERVED A GOD ONCE. AN IMPOSSIBLY VAST COSMIC COMMUNIST CIVILIZATION THAT CAELAFORMED THE UNIVERSE 108 KALPAS AGO.</p><p><strong>Prestige Accessory · 3 kg · 4,000,000 ♄</strong> · d6: 6</p><p><strong>Replaces one Arm and can work as a WROUGHT ARM. +1 to KILL THE BUDDHA Checks with a weapon held in that Hand.</strong></p>",
